From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: maslow <wangfugen@126.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 13:07:09 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add private runtime root loading with explicit creation
 records

Compile owned Worker configs, keep namespaces independent from compiled instances, and use the existing limit and lifecycle hooks. Guard retirement by generation and instance identity.

